<title>UK: Denmark sets 500 mln mark five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 500 mln mark five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    24.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.566   PAY DATE   S24.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.816    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
